  "difficulty_level": "H2",
  "difficulty_reason": "The author combines forbidden-submatrix gadget structure with nested high-minimum-weight certificate restrictions, sensitive-block reductions and parity-query simulation to establish the deterministic lifting dichotomy, whose threshold differs from randomized communication.",
