    "conclusion": "unique_within_reviewed_scope",
    "scope": "Actual journal DOI and CCC/ECCC aliases absent in legacy/prepared snapshots and root active-line searches. Independent deterministic communication classification6.10, with constant-cost nonlifting and AND/XOR or OR/XOR positive cases absent from randomized6.7. Supporting certificate and matrix lemmas are uncounted.",
